  "task_scope": "正式语料连续窗口盲抽取；事件数量和边界未知。",
  "source_segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0069",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 69,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0069",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：23：16"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0070",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 70,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0070",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：第二天晚上，我们685团晚上攻东西跑池的时候，天亮以前都撤到山头上来了。你这个机枪要瞄准敌人打上几发子弹，你不走开，他过一会，他就把你机枪手给打死了，他射击有这么准。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0071",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 71,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0071",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：24：02"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0072",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 72,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0072",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：所以你趴在那里呀，白天啊你一露头，他就打过来了，你打一枪，赶快往后退，往山后面。你在那趴久了，他瞄准你就打了。所以日本兵，他在国内他有的是子弹啊，另外那兵都比较老，都三年五年以上的兵。有些兵是职业兵，他不是临时的，它是“板垣师团”，“板垣师团”是有名的进攻中国，到哪个地方主要进攻的时候，他这个“板垣师团”就去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0073",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 73,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0073",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：对，精锐部队，是一个精锐部队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0074",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 74,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0074",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：25：00"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0075",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 75,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0075",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：精锐部队啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0076",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 76,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0076",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：有没有提到过日本人刺杀，咱们是不是吃亏了？因为我听说平型关大捷之后啊，部队上加强了这个刺杀训练是吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0077",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 77,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0077",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：对，各部队都加强训练。平型关的时候咱们也拼过刺刀，因为他突然之间我们打蒙了，他就找隐蔽地方打，所以拼刺刀这个情况呢不太多，一下子把他打蒙了。但是686团打老爷庙的时候啊，我听他们说伤亡是比较大的。因为我们露在外边，他守在那个庙里头，686团伤亡也不小。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0078",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 78,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0078",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：26：00"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0079",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 79,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0079",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：您老准备要抓这个俘虏，也没用上是吧?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0080",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 80,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0080",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：那个时候不懂，日本人说日本话，咱们喊口号呢根本不起作用，他听不懂，他那边咕噜咕噜说话咱们也听不懂，所以平型关战斗，我们这个685团没有抓住活的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0081",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 81,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0081",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：那时候有没有想到要带一个翻译过来呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0082",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 82,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0082",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：没有条件呀，出发抗战时候没有准备这个，但是那个时候我们上边也不知道有没有，反正我们部队没有。到了以后，才来了一个东北的大学生，会日文，才到我们政治处里边作为敌工干事，他教我们喊话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0083",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 83,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0083",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：27：20"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0084",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 84,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0084",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：教我们拼音，あいうえお（a、i、u、e、o）はひふへほ（ha、hi、hu、he、ho）（日语）50个字母，缴枪不杀，缴枪Giositelu Kilosanayi（日语），意思是你缴枪我不杀你，你说咱们中国话“缴枪不杀”，他听不懂。所以咱们没有这个翻译的准备，连师部都没有，不要说团里头了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0085",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 85,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0085",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：连师里边都没有想到这方面的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0086",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 86,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0086",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：28：00"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0087",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 87,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0087",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：应该我们上面有这个有文化的人，但是好像没有准备这个人才。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0088",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 88,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0088",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：这是俘虏。担架方面什么情况？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0089",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 89,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0089",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：担架，那时候是我们团里边啊，卫生队多少不一，当时我们团里有10副，准备（给）自身的战士。我们长征的时候，一个团是10副担架，一副担架是5个人，两个人抬一次，要换班，还预备一个，哪一个实在不行再替上去。我们那个团的担架队到过雪山的时候还有三十个人，就是原来的时候有五十个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0090",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 90,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0090",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：29：13"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0091",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 91,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0091",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：就是这个战斗的第二天，第一天就打成这个（情况），第二天的时候，685团就是攻东西跑池吧，地图上有，686团就要攻老爷庙。第二天的大概是下午，敌人的增援就来了。那天呢我正好往前去， 687团他就在离战场几里路的地方，在那里休息，就准备随时加入战斗吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0092",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 92,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0092",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：30：15"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0093",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 93,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0093",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：当时我认识谭甫仁，谭甫仁是中将吧，他原来跟我一个部队的，我就跟他进里说了说话，我们到陕北以后，他就到15军团去当师政委去了吧，到平型关作战可能师改团，他可能是团政委，我们在那里见了面。到那天下午，我不是在第二天往前去看嘛，师的教导队呀出去抬战利品，山这个地方有个小洼洼（杨永松比划山势），翻过山就过去了，这边呢就站着岗。我背着个手枪，没带行李，我就往前走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0094",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 94,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0094",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：31：25"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0095",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 95,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0095",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：“哎，同志，你干嘛去呀？”我说部队打了两天了，我去看看去。“哎！没有特殊情况不让去，现在这个情况紧张，敌人增援了。”他说那个方向已经发现了。大概我就往回走的时候，687团他就从右翼参加战斗了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH01-DOC03-S0096",
      "document_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH01-DOC03",
      "segment_order": 96,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "02.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0096",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：31：57"
    }
  ]
}
